          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When Israel was a child, then I loved him, and called my son out of Egypt. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The more ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " called them, the more they went from them: they sacrificed unto the Baalim, and burned incense to graven images. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yet I taught Ephraim to walk; I took them on my arms; but they knew not that I healed them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I drew them with cords of a man, with bands of love; and I was to them as they that lift up the yoke on their jaws; and I laid food before them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.11.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They shall not return into the land of Egypt; but the Assyrian shall be their king, because they refused to return ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the sword shall fall upon their cities, and shall consume their bars, and devour ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", because of their own counsels. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And my people are bent on backsliding from me: though they call them to ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " on high, none at all will exalt ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.11.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "How shall I give thee up, Ephraim? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " shall I cast thee off, Israel? how shall I make thee as Admah? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " shall I set thee as Zeboiim? my heart is turned within me, my compassions are kindled together. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will not execute the fierceness of mine anger, I will not return to destroy Ephraim: for I am God, and not man; the Holy One in the midst of thee; and I will not come in wrath. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They shall walk after Jehovah, who will roar like a lion; for he will roar, and the children shall come trembling from the west. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They shall come trembling as a bird out of Egypt, and as a dove out of the land of Assyria; and I will make them to dwell in their houses, saith Jehovah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.11.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ephraim compasseth me about with falsehood, and the house of Israel with deceit; but Judah yet ruleth with God, and is faithful with the Holy One.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.11.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
